# 无保守相互作用的 Langevin 粒子系综；两类型保持相同摩擦系数 gamma=m/damp=1。
units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
region box block 0 64 0 64 0 64
create_box 2 box
create_atoms 1 random 512 13579 box
create_atoms 2 random 512 24680 box
mass 1 1
mass 2 10
group light type 1
group heavy type 2
pair_style zero 1.0
pair_coeff * *
neighbor 0.3 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 0.01
velocity all create 1.0 76543 mom no rot no dist gaussian
fix integrate all nve
fix bath all langevin 1.0 1.0 1.0 918273 scale 2 10.0
compute light_msd light msd
compute heavy_msd heavy msd
fix sample all ave/time 10 1 10 c_light_msd[4] c_heavy_msd[4] file msd.dat
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp
run 20000
